WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.125 --> 00:00:08.680
I am a good helper.

2
00:00:08.681 --> 00:00:19.026
I help Daddy fix the car.

3
00:00:19.027 --> 00:00:27.602
I help Mommy water the garden.

4
00:00:27.603 --> 00:00:36.100
I help my neighbor feed her pet

5
00:00:36.101 --> 00:00:45.626
rabbit. I help my friend do his homework.

6
00:00:45.627 --> 00:00:55.838
I help my teacher clean the classroom.

7
00:00:55.839 --> 00:01:01.890
I help my brother cross the street.

8
00:01:01.891 --> 00:01:04.883
Are you a good helper too?

9
00:01:04.884 --> 00:01:11.892
How do you help people?

